{"stories":{"ep4/npcpanel_menu_9007680":{"episode":"ep4","category":"npcpanel_menu","story_id":"9007680","sequence_index":168,"plot_row_index":"17532","order_index":"17532","numeric_id":"9007680","physical_section":"ep4","plot_id":"9007680","dialogue_kind":"Menu","metadata_source":"story_metadata_generated_context","metadata_sources":["story_metadata_context"],"summary":"","context_summary_source_cn":"凯登混在领取灵露的人群中，被卫兵揪出来后离开。因度厄来换班后，你也领取到了灵露。凯登再次返回，并在队伍中孽化。平民们愤怒地阻拦卫兵处置凯登。","context_summary_i18n":{"cn":"凯登混在领取灵露的人群中，被卫兵揪出来后离开。因度厄来换班后，你也领取到了灵露。凯登再次返回，并在队伍中孽化。平民们愤怒地阻拦卫兵处置凯登。","en":"Caiden blends in with the Divine Dew recipients, but a guard spots him and urges him to leave. You receive your share of the Divine Dew when Indris arrives to take over the shift. Sometime later, Caiden returns and becomes corrupted in the midst of the crowd. The commoners angrily stop the guards from executing Caiden.","jp":"列に紛れ込んでいたケイデンは衛兵に引きずり出され、その場を追われた。インドラが交代で到着すると、あなたも無事に霊水を受け取れた。しかしケイデンが再び戻って来た時、厄化してしまった。平民たちは怒り狂い、衛兵の行動を阻んだ。","kr":"은혜의 이슬을 받으려는 사람들 사이에 섞여 들어간 케이든은 근위병에게 들켜서 도망쳤다. 그리고 인듀어가 교대하자 나는 무사히 은혜의 이슬을 받았다. 다시 돌아온 케이든은 줄을 서던 중 죄악화되었고 분노에 찬 평민들은 근위병들이 케이든을 처단하지 못하게 막았다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":24502,"context_summary_record_indices":[24502],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep4/npcpanel_menu_7007620","context_summary_direction":"next_plot_summary","context_summary_distance":4,"episode_title_source_cn":"渊火龙诗","episode_title_i18n":{"cn":"渊火龙诗","en":"Echoes of Dissent","jp":"深焔の竜歌","kr":"에세일의 노래"},"episode_title_status":{"cn":"exact_unique","en":"exact_unique","jp":"exact_unique","kr":"exact_unique"},"episode_title_evidence":{"source":"Config/Season.luae","table_key":"104","season_type":"104","entry_condition":"ed.ConditionX.IsUserInEp(\"Ep04\")","opening_quest":"14010101","episode